<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.7">
<l>viṟpiṭit tiṟuttu vēḻattai murukki mēlirun tavaṉtalai cāṭi</l>
<l>maṟporu teḻappāyn taraiyaṉai yutaitta mālpuru ṭōttamaṉ vāḻ</l>
<l>vaṟputa muṭaiyai rāvata matamu mavariḷam paṭiyaroṇ cāntuṅ</l>
<l>kaṟpaka malaruṅ kalantiḻi kaṅkaik kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The dwelling of Māl Puruṣottama</l>
<l rend="indent">who grabbed and broke the bow, crushed the elephant</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] beat the head of the one who sat atop [it]</l>
<l rend="indent">Lept up to fight the wrestlers, and kicked the king,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam on the Ganges</l>
<l rend="indent">which descends, mixing the blossoms of the Kaṟpaka tree</l>
<l rend="indent">[with] the ichor of Indra’s marvelous elephant</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] the bright sandal paste [worn by] his damsels.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
